e query, we mine a number of similar phrases using approximate nearest neighbour search. These sampled phrases are then used as negative examples in the context list alongside random and ground...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/nearest-neighbor-phrase","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["transformer","speech recognition"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:ecgjhej1kbhmk7w7pyjfnnmq","title":"A Unifying Theory of Distance from Calibration","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/unifying-theory-distance","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/unifying-theory-distance"],"alternate_titles":["A Unifying Theory of Distance from Calibration"],"published":"2023-06-13","authors":["Jarosław Błasiok","Parikshit Gopalan","Lunjia Hu","Preetum Nakkiran"],"abstract":"We study the fundamental question of how to define and measure the distance from calibration for probabilistic predictors. While the notion of perfect calibration is well-understood, there is no consensus on how to quantify the distance from perfect calibration. 